      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXPEDITE (1) hit the ground running and set it up early clocking 30.00 with a one length win at this track over 520m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. The one to beat again. TO XIBALBA (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at Q Lakeside in a handy 25.29 beating Terra Bella. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature again. BEST SUMMER (3) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. Scored by 2.5 lengths last time (29.86) in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. Suited here and expected to run well. HARA'S TYRION (6) can sneak into the finish again.",
